7207fa18: c, cs and cpp carry optional-over-variable; r1 caught a resolution dropping it). PATHS: the standing forward-merge ruling grants merge-carried files byte-identical to the merged parent; PATHS lists the real 1238 changed files as subdirectory globs (never a bare internal/**), and NEW names the files of the directories new at BASE." :brief-file "docs/roadmap-briefs/schema-cards-out-2026-10-19.sexp")
